cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data set, cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Music Genre Taxonomy"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/UniversalSyntropy/music-genre-taxonomy"
url: "https://universalsyntropy.github.io/music-genre-taxonomy/"
abstract: "An open music genre taxonomy: genres and subgenres in a hierarchy (a directed acyclic graph) as JSON and CSV. It joins MusicBrainz, Discogs and Wikidata. Every parent link names its source, licence and evidence. Genres carry MusicBrainz and Wikidata ids and Discogs names, plus name aliases for tag matching. A versioned JSON Schema and a web viewer are included."
keywords:
  - music genres
  - genre taxonomy
  - genre hierarchy
  - subgenres
  - genre ontology
  - dataset
  - MusicBrainz
  - Discogs
  - Wikidata
  - open data
authors:
  - name: "music-genre-taxonomy contributors"
